# Oscorp Industries: Mayhem on a land (CR 702.187a) lets it be played from the graveyard if it was discarded this turn (CR 305.1),
# using the turn's land play (CR 305.2). Faithless Looting draws it and an Island and Bot1 discards both; Oscorp is played from the
# graveyard, tapped. It entered from a graveyard (CR 400.7): Bot1 loses 2 life, and the Island stays in the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Faithless Looting
Island x5
Oscorp Industries
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Oscorp Industries; Island)
? Bot1.Graveyard = Faithless Looting; Island; Oscorp Industries
Bot1.Graveyard.Oscorp Industries.Play
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Oscorp Industries.Tapped = true

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 18
Bot1.Graveyard = Faithless Looting; Island
Bot1.Battlefield.Oscorp Industries.Tapped = true
